<title>USA: Vastar Resources in 26 successful bids.</title>
<headline>Vastar Resources in 26 successful bids.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vastar Resources Inc said Friday it was the apparent successful bidder, solely or with others, on 26 tracts in Wednesday's Outer Continental Shelf Western Gulf of Mexico, Oil and Gas Lease Sale 161.</p>
<p>If all the tracts were awarded, Vastar said, it would spend about $14 million.</p>
<p>&quot;We expect to drill several tracts early next year,&quot; the company said.</p>
<p>It said 16 of the tracts are located in water deeper than 200 meters. The remaining 10 tracts are located on the Gulf of Mexico shelf. -- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
